  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CC UNEP Africa Marine and Coastal Programme - HaV service agreement refund 2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CC UNEP Afrika Havs och Kust Porgram</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let med &quot;the Africa Marine and Coastal programme&quot;  &#xe4;r att bidra till implementeringen av UNEP&apos;s marina strategi i Afrika f&#xf6;r att uppn&#xe5; &quot;rika och friska hav och kuster d&#xe4;r skydd, produktion   och resursutnyttjande &#xe4;r l&#xe5;ngsiktigt h&#xe5;llbar&quot;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Africa Marine and Coastal programme is   to assist in implementing UNEP&apos;s Marine and Coastal Strategy in       Africa for &quot;prosperous and healthy oceans and coasts where            conservation, productivity and resource use are sustainable&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
